      <Desc>MARKETING OF THE SAN DIEGO GASLAMP QUARTER WITH THE CONTINUING FOCUS ON EXPOSING THIS AREA THROUGH PROMOTIONS AND SPECIAL EVENTS. VARIOUS SPECIAL EVENTS BROUGHT THOUSANDS OF VISITORS TO THE GASLAMP QUARTER IN DOWNTOWN SAN DIEGO.OUTREACH OF MEMBERS INCLUDING EDUCATION AND INTERACTION THROUGH MEETINGS, NEWSLETTERS, EMAIL BLASTS, AND AWARDS DINNER, A GOLF TOURNAMENT AND OTHER COMMUNICATIONS. BEGAN THE NEW GQA WEBSITE WITH WILL FOCUS ON NEW BRANDING AND PROMOTIONS OF THE GASLAMP QUARTER.REPRESENTATION OF THE GASLAMP QUARTER ASSOCIATION IN CITY COUNCIL MEETINGS, TOURISM PROMOTION ORGANIZATIONS, AND OTHER CIVIC ORGANIZATIONS TO IMPROVE OVERALL CONDITIONS IN THE DISTRICT. OVERALL CONDITIONS INCLUDE ADVISING THE CITY ON HOMELESS AND PARKING ISSUES WITHIN THE DISTRICT.</Desc>
